{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】美國一名海軍陸戰隊員在日本沖繩訓練期間死亡。</p>\n<p>海軍陸戰隊第三師發聲明指，一名隊員周二在沖繩施瓦布營訓練期間因事故喪生，當局於通知死者家屬24小時後才會公布其身份。海軍陸戰隊沒有透露死者是否當場死亡，以及是否有其他傷者。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:45:28.063697+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:20:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:41.179147+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:41.179147+00:00","content_hash":"c5d3a267ea6206166da51b374e3a76c54f9aacdef4ad124141ff89d14d722076","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}